<div class="story-box">
    <h2>Book 1: The Sorcerer's Stone</h2>
    <img class="story-banner" src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQxrzsI8mIA6AtGfIOdCtsN8al56PMZPMBFhBCjhbLYv8kez-dmh00HRLw3_lobF4fv8sNh&s=10" alt="Sorcerer's Stone">
    <p class="story-body">Harry Potter's life changes forever on his eleventh birthday when he discovers he is a wizard. Leaving the mundane Muggle world behind, he steps through Platform 9 ¾ and enters Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry, where he uncovers a magical world of flying broomsticks, moving staircases, and a dark mystery hidden deep beneath the castle floors.</p>
